{"articleNo":"185706","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=185706&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[Kanazawa Univeristy] Call for Schlarship Application for 2018 Japanese Goverment Scholarship","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.12.26","hit":"4377","attachments":[{"name":"MEXT Scholarship 2018.zip","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=185706&attachNo=77406"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\">일본 카나자와 대학교에서 일본정부초청 대학원생을 다음과 같이 모집하고 있습니다. </font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">관심있는 학생들의 지원 바랍니다. </font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\"></font></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\">Dear Exchange colleagues,<!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\">I would like to express our gratitude for your cooperation concerning the student exchange with our university.<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">I would like to send you that the call for </font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">‘‘</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">2018 JAPANESE GOVERNMENT (MONBUKAGAKUSHO) SCHOLARSHIP FOR RESEARCH STUDENT</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">’’</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">. <o:p></o:p></font></span></font></font></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">This scholarship program is not for the exchange program but mainly for people who seeks a Master</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">’</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">s or Doctoral degree at Kanazawa University. For details, please kindly check the attached file, </font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">‘‘</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">MEXT Scholarship 2018</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;\">’’</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">. <o:p></o:p></font></span></font></font></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">We would appreciate</font></span><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">　</font><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\">it if you could pass information to anyone who may be interested. <o:p></o:p></font></font></span></font></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Applications must reach the prospective graduate school at Kanazawa University by JANUARY 26, 2018. <o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Before submit the application, the applicants must find the supervisor here in Kanazawa University. <o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Following page will help you to find the supervisor in Kanazawa University;<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\">&nbsp; </span></font></font></font><a href=\"http://ridb.kanazawa-u.ac.jp/public/index_en.php\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">http://ridb.kanazawa-u.ac.jp/public/index_en.php</font></u></a><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">The graduate school will inform the applicant and your institution of the result of the scholarship selection in the middle of June (not fixed).<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">Please do not hesitate to contact Ms. Kazumi Yabuta at the Global Affairs Support Office (E-mail: </font><a href=\"mailto:ryukou@adm.kanazawa-u.ac.jp\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">ryukou@adm.kanazawa-u.ac.jp</font></u></a><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">)</font><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\">&nbsp; </font></span><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#000000\">for further questions or concerns regarding the application.<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Thank you very much for your time and energy for our mutual relationship.<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Sincerely yours,<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">HAYASHI Akemi (Ms.)<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Head, Global Affairs Support Office<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">***********************************<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">International Student Section<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Global Affairs Support Office<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Kanazawa University<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">Kakuma, Kanazawa, Ishikawa<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">920-1192 Japan<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"tel:+81-76-264-5193\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">TEL:+81-76-264-5193</font></u></a><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"2\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\">FAX:+81-76-234-4043<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">E-mail: </font><a href=\"mailto:ryukou@adm.kanazawa-u.ac.jp\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">ryukou@adm.kanazawa-u.ac.jp</font></u></a><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"2\" face=\"맑은 고딕\">*********************************** </font><o:p></o:p></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
